Hi,

I would like to insert math symbols in these text fields.
Is there a way to use Mathjax?

And related issues:
When I add “<” character to a string in a text field (title of legend) it is rendered as “&lt”.
When I add UTF-8 character “≤” or “\u2264” it gives a warning without plotting.

Is there a way to add such special characters?

Thanks,
Shay.
